<title>UK: Wurth Finance sets 100 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Wurth Finance sets 100 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers UBS Zurich and CSFB Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WURTH FINANCE INTERNATIONAL BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ADOLF WURTH GMBH &amp; CO KG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    15.APR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    15.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
